{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートいつもありがとーうございます(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中間子さーん少ないねやっぱり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはひとりっこに憧れたり、でもやっぱ寂しいんかなーとか思ったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無い物ねだりだよねーそんなもんよ。うーん(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ひめたんはいつでもお兄ちゃんお姉ちゃん募集中だからね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待っとるよーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のしつもーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色は何ですかー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーそうだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前の話になるけどね、ままと一緒にお料理教室行ってきた(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あっぷをはかろうとしたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理教室ってお名前だけでちょっと勝ち組な気がするじゃーん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で完成品がこちらーどーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー可愛い味よ(*>ω<*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生さすがですねー女子力高い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもそんな素敵な女性になりたいですー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"６月じゃけ上にあじさいのってんの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レシピ載せたらいけんような気がするけ、写真から材料とか作り方とか感じとってみてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいじょぶ。みんな天才だから絶対わかるよ。わかるからー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても知りたいのに写真だけじゃわかんないって人は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんに今度あった時にでも聞いてみてねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーそうだそうだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"under stationがアップされました!公式サイトでぜひチェックしてみてねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで聴いてくれた方、今回特別にひめたんとろってぃ(川村真洋chan)の生うたが聴けちゃうよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタばらしいえあー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人ともうたうの好きなのね。だから、下りは忘れちゃったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく生うた披露した(^O^)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうーチェックするしかーでしょ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱、最高で何度出たことある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"40℃超えたことあーるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にハイになってたと思う(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分熱でふわふわしとったんだろうねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう辛いとか頭痛いとかゆーの超越してしまったもんー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わひゃひゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力ってなんなの(笑)?詳しく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"く詳しくー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろね。女子力。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「わーこいつすげーさすが女子ー。」って思わせるぱわーじゃん(*/ω＼*)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。そう。それが足りないのよひめたんにはー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコはお好きでっか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレート系のスイーツは、好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコお好きよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからだめなのよねーほんとにね。うーん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず最近しばらく脱チョコなーうですよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこ食べたーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこれいとーはーめっいーじっだよねーんー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツパラダイスって行ったことある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツ大好きなら行ったことあるよね!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイパラ行ったことあーる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京で行ったことあるけど、広島のはないんだよなーこれが('ー`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒だよね?今度いつか地元のスイパラにもお邪魔するしかーあー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね。甘いもん大好きなんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイパラ行った時はお腹いっぱいなりすぎて、自分ケーキになるかと思ったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので、みなさんくれぐれもケーキにならんように気をつけてね!はーと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男のひとに、作ってもらいたい、お菓子ってありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何作ってくれても嬉しいけれどもー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりオーブンは使ってほしいよね。なんとなーく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの、なんだっけー熱いもの持つときに手にはめるやつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー名前出てこないけど、とにかくそれしてたらかっこいいと思う(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根拠なんてなーい!わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートムースが、主で、ピスタチオの、ビスキュイと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムースが挟んであるムースがケーキは、お好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにそれ美味しそうすぎる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べてみたーい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ひめたんがおるとこまで投げてよーキャッチするからさー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトダイエットします。応援してくれるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっちろん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいね。ひめたんトマト好きくないから、とまと食べるってだけで尊敬する。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁいとーうお＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0668875/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に宣言したダイエットは順調?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近それ悩んでるー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと頑張らんにゃーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}